  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is morning. It is a good day. Lily and Tom go to Grandma's apartment. Pip goes with them. Grandma opens the door. \"Good morning!\" she says. \"Come in, come in.\" \"Do you want breakfast?\" \"Yes, please!\" says Lily.",
      "The kitchen is small. The table is white. Grandma has a lot of food. She has bread and eggs. She has green beans too. \"I like bread,\" says Tom. Lily has an egg and milk. Grandpa sits in his armchair. He has a book. The armchair is old and big.",
      "Pip sits next to Grandpa. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Grandpa smiles. \"Does Pip want food?\" he asks. \"Here, Pip. A bean!\" Pip eats the bean. Then he looks at the bread. \"No, Pip,\" says Grandma. They smile."
    ],
    "summary": "Lily and Tom eat breakfast in Grandma's apartment. Grandpa sits in his armchair, and Pip waits for food.",
